      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Agriculture remains the heart of Maple Hill, with local farms producing ham meats, turkeys, and even a 75‑acre alpaca farm that hosts educational events.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        13,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitpender.com/maple-hill",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Families in Maple Hill can trace their roots back to Welsh settlers of the 18th century, a lineage that still thrives in the area’s farms today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
