      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitpender.com/maple-hill",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Maple Hill’s diverse community includes descendants of freed slaves who settled after emancipation, contributing to a rich cultural tapestry.",
